+        /// Planchette: a view hidden for a while gives back its render targets
+        /// (and custom shader textures): one screen-sized texture per frame of
+        /// the swap chain, which a host with many hidden terminals holds for
+        /// nothing. Each is shrunk to 1x1; drawFrame sizes a frame's target
